{"duration": 311.1333125, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.88, "text": "This is Machu Picchu. The year is 1912. A field of rubble. And this is also Machu Picchu.", "words": [[0.0, 0.38, " This"], [0.38, 0.66, " is"], [0.66, 1.04, " Machu"], [1.04, 1.44, " Picchu."], [1.84, 2.04, " The"], [2.04, 2.24, " year"], [2.24, 2.4, " is"], [2.4, 3.38, " 1912."], [3.74, 3.96, " A"], [3.96, 4.18, " field"], [4.18, 4.4, " of"], [4.4, 4.88, " rubble."], [5.22, 5.38, " And"], [5.38, 5.58, " this"], [5.58, 5.84, " is"], [5.84, 6.1, " also"], [6.1, 6.5, " Machu"], [6.5, 6.88, " Picchu."]]}, {"start": 7.28, "end": 11.68, "text": "The same place. Over a hundred years and one decision. What to show?", "words": [[7.28, 7.5, " The"], [7.5, 7.7, " same"], [7.7, 8.18, " place."], [8.78, 9.02, " Over"], [9.02, 9.12, " a"], [9.12, 9.42, " hundred"], [9.42, 9.78, " years"], [9.78, 10.02, " and"], [10.02, 10.2, " one"], [10.2, 10.7, " decision."], [11.02, 11.18, " What"], [11.18, 11.42, " to"], [11.42, 11.68, " show?"]]}, {"start": 12.66, "end": 16.48, "text": "Every vlog shows you this version. And nobody is lying to you.", "words": [[12.66, 13.0, " Every"], [13.0, 13.32, " vlog"], [13.32, 13.62, " shows"], [13.62, 13.82, " you"], [13.82, 14.02, " this"], [14.02, 14.4, " version."], [14.88, 15.12, " And"], [15.12, 15.4, " nobody"], [15.4, 15.74, " is"], [15.74, 15.92, " lying"], [15.92, 16.16, " to"], [16.16, 16.48, " you."]]}, {"start": 17.34, "end": 29.98, "text": "A frame does not lie. A frame chooses. Eight places from one vlog. Then I show you how it", "words": [[17.34, 17.6, " A"], [17.6, 17.78, " frame"], [17.78, 18.02, " does"], [18.02, 18.22, " not"], [18.22, 18.52, " lie."], [19.0, 19.2, " A"], [19.2, 19.4, " frame"], [19.4, 19.88, " chooses."], [20.54, 20.8, " Eight"], [20.8, 21.14, " places"], [21.14, 21.4, " from"], [21.4, 21.62, " one"], [21.62, 21.94, " vlog."], [22.48, 22.62, " Then"], [22.62, 22.84, " I"], [22.84, 23.0, " show"], [23.0, 23.16, " you"], [23.16, 23.28, " how"], [23.28, 29.98, " it"]]}, {"start": 29.98, "end": 37.84, "text": "Our choice. Height. Weather. Every place gets a stamp. We start with Machu Picchu.", "words": [[29.98, 30.96, " Our"], [30.96, 32.1, " choice."], [32.94, 33.5, " Height."], [33.74, 34.1, " Weather."], [34.76, 35.06, " Every"], [35.06, 35.34, " place"], [35.34, 35.56, " gets"], [35.56, 35.78, " a"], [35.78, 36.0, " stamp."], [36.56, 36.68, " We"], [36.68, 36.9, " start"], [36.9, 37.16, " with"], [37.16, 37.56, " Machu"], [37.56, 37.84, " Picchu."]]}, {"start": 39.44, "end": 45.4, "text": "This is how the place looked in 1912. Hiram Bingham's expedition found a field of rubble.", "words": [[39.44, 40.0, " This"], [40.0, 40.2, " is"], [40.2, 40.36, " how"], [40.36, 40.58, " the"], [40.58, 40.78, " place"], [40.78, 41.0, " looked"], [41.0, 41.28, " in"], [41.28, 42.18, " 1912."], [42.5, 42.7, " Hiram"], [42.7, 43.3, " Bingham's"], [43.3, 43.9, " expedition"], [43.9, 44.38, " found"], [44.38, 44.6, " a"], [44.6, 44.76, " field"], [44.76, 44.96, " of"], [44.96, 45.4, " rubble."]]}, {"start": 45.64, "end": 52.22, "text": "Then came the restoration. 1929 to 1971. The vlog shows the place after the work.", "words": [[45.64, 45.88, " Then"], [45.88, 46.12, " came"], [46.12, 46.32, " the"], [46.32, 47.04, " restoration."], [47.94, 48.5, " 1929"], [48.5, 48.9, " to"], [48.9, 49.74, " 1971."], [50.18, 50.38, " The"], [50.38, 50.7, " vlog"], [50.7, 50.98, " shows"], [50.98, 51.24, " the"], [51.24, 51.44, " place"], [51.44, 51.72, " after"], [51.72, 51.92, " the"], [51.92, 52.22, " work."]]}, {"start": 52.54, "end": 58.74, "text": "And today the Citadel admits up to 4500 visitors a day. In peak season, 5600,", "words": [[52.54, 52.8, " And"], [52.8, 53.06, " today"], [53.06, 53.28, " the"], [53.28, 53.82, " Citadel"], [53.82, 54.2, " admits"], [54.2, 54.46, " up"], [54.46, 54.7, " to"], [54.7, 55.5, " 4500"], [55.5, 55.9, " visitors"], [55.9, 56.14, " a"], [56.14, 56.44, " day."], [56.78, 57.04, " In"], [57.04, 57.22, " peak"], [57.22, 57.68, " season,"], [58.04, 58.74, " 5600,"]]}, {"start": 58.74, "end": 63.78, "text": "the clip shows no crowd and that is a choice too. Verdict the frame chooses.", "words": [[58.74, 59.38, " the"], [59.38, 59.6, " clip"], [59.6, 59.92, " shows"], [59.92, 60.16, " no"], [60.16, 60.46, " crowd"], [60.46, 60.88, " and"], [60.88, 61.02, " that"], [61.02, 61.2, " is"], [61.2, 61.3, " a"], [61.3, 61.5, " choice"], [61.5, 62.12, " too."], [62.52, 62.76, " Verdict"], [62.76, 62.98, " the"], [62.98, 63.2, " frame"], [63.2, 63.78, " chooses."]]}, {"start": 65.62, "end": 71.3, "text": "A beautiful frame. And not one person in it. Without a person, a mountain has no scale.", "words": [[65.62, 65.74, " A"], [65.74, 66.12, " beautiful"], [66.12, 66.6, " frame."], [67.2, 67.36, " And"], [67.36, 67.58, " not"], [67.58, 67.8, " one"], [67.8, 68.18, " person"], [68.18, 68.38, " in"], [68.38, 68.7, " it."], [68.98, 69.24, " Without"], [69.24, 69.46, " a"], [69.46, 69.82, " person,"], [70.14, 70.22, " a"], [70.22, 70.5, " mountain"], [70.5, 70.76, " has"], [70.76, 70.98, " no"], [70.98, 71.3, " scale."]]}, {"start": 73.48, "end": 81.18, "text": "Look at Ahmedablam. 6812 meters. For several days, it dominates the eastern sky for anyone", "words": [[73.48, 73.64, " Look"], [73.64, 73.84, " at"], [73.84, 74.4, " Ahmedablam."], [75.76, 76.4, " 6812"], [76.4, 76.86, " meters."], [77.36, 77.58, " For"], [77.58, 77.9, " several"], [77.9, 78.38, " days,"], [78.6, 78.76, " it"], [78.76, 79.22, " dominates"], [79.22, 79.44, " the"], [79.44, 79.86, " eastern"], [79.86, 80.26, " sky"], [80.26, 80.8, " for"], [80.8, 81.18, " anyone"]]}, {"start": 81.18, "end": 86.66, "text": "trekking to Everest base camp. And these are the Gokyo lakes in Sagarmatha National Park.", "words": [[81.18, 81.58, " trekking"], [81.58, 81.84, " to"], [81.84, 82.14, " Everest"], [82.14, 82.5, " base"], [82.5, 82.82, " camp."], [83.14, 83.4, " And"], [83.4, 83.64, " these"], [83.64, 83.84, " are"], [83.84, 83.96, " the"], [83.96, 84.28, " Gokyo"], [84.28, 84.68, " lakes"], [84.68, 85.16, " in"], [85.16, 85.74, " Sagarmatha"], [85.74, 86.22, " National"], [86.22, 86.66, " Park."]]}, {"start": 86.66, "end": 93.54, "text": "Between 4700 and 5000 meters above sea level. Now find the two tiny figures on the slope.", "words": [[86.66, 87.3, " Between"], [87.3, 88.48, " 4700"], [88.48, 88.82, " and"], [88.82, 89.42, " 5000"], [89.42, 89.96, " meters"], [89.96, 90.32, " above"], [90.32, 90.64, " sea"], [90.64, 90.96, " level."], [91.38, 91.56, " Now"], [91.56, 91.8, " find"], [91.8, 92.0, " the"], [92.0, 92.2, " two"], [92.2, 92.58, " tiny"], [92.58, 92.88, " figures"], [92.88, 93.08, " on"], [93.08, 93.28, " the"], [93.28, 93.54, " slope."]]}, {"start": 93.98, "end": 100.94, "text": "That is the real scale. Verdict reality is bigger. Two cyclists and a red mesa.", "words": [[93.98, 94.16, " That"], [94.16, 94.34, " is"], [94.34, 94.5, " the"], [94.5, 94.72, " real"], [94.72, 95.22, " scale."], [95.7, 96.14, " Verdict"], [96.14, 96.6, " reality"], [96.6, 96.88, " is"], [96.88, 97.2, " bigger."], [99.28, 99.56, " Two"], [99.56, 100.12, " cyclists"], [100.12, 100.32, " and"], [100.32, 100.44, " a"], [100.44, 100.6, " red"], [100.6, 100.94, " mesa."]]}, {"start": 101.52, "end": 109.21, "text": "An honest frame. But it is a fraction of the road. This road is White Rim in Canyonlands", "words": [[101.52, 101.82, " An"], [101.82, 102.1, " honest"], [102.1, 102.44, " frame."], [103.0, 103.16, " But"], [103.16, 103.32, " it"], [103.32, 103.48, " is"], [103.48, 103.64, " a"], [103.64, 103.9, " fraction"], [103.9, 104.06, " of"], [104.06, 104.22, " the"], [104.22, 104.46, " road."], [106.91, 107.19, " This"], [107.19, 107.39, " road"], [107.39, 107.65, " is"], [107.65, 107.89, " White"], [107.89, 108.13, " Rim"], [108.13, 108.61, " in"], [108.61, 109.21, " Canyonlands"]]}, {"start": 109.21, "end": 117.55, "text": "National Park. 71 miles. About 115 kilometers. All of it unpaved. It was built in the 1950s", "words": [[109.21, 109.69, " National"], [109.69, 110.17, " Park."], [110.53, 110.97, " 71"], [110.97, 111.59, " miles."], [111.79, 112.11, " About"], [112.11, 112.83, " 115"], [112.83, 113.63, " kilometers."], [114.13, 114.33, " All"], [114.33, 114.43, " of"], [114.43, 114.61, " it"], [114.61, 115.17, " unpaved."], [115.63, 115.77, " It"], [115.77, 115.95, " was"], [115.95, 116.17, " built"], [116.17, 116.33, " in"], [116.33, 116.49, " the"], [116.49, 117.55, " 1950s"]]}, {"start": 117.55, "end": 122.59, "text": "below the island in the sky mesa. Why so prospectors could reach uranium deposits?", "words": [[117.55, 117.87, " below"], [117.87, 118.17, " the"], [118.17, 118.47, " island"], [118.47, 118.63, " in"], [118.63, 118.81, " the"], [118.81, 118.99, " sky"], [118.99, 119.39, " mesa."], [119.87, 120.15, " Why"], [120.15, 120.41, " so"], [120.41, 121.05, " prospectors"], [121.05, 121.25, " could"], [121.25, 121.49, " reach"], [121.49, 122.03, " uranium"], [122.03, 122.59, " deposits?"]]}, {"start": 123.13, "end": 127.97, "text": "Now see it from above, over the green river. The river winds through canyons far below.", "words": [[123.13, 123.33, " Now"], [123.33, 123.53, " see"], [123.53, 123.65, " it"], [123.65, 123.83, " from"], [123.83, 124.21, " above,"], [124.39, 124.59, " over"], [124.59, 124.79, " the"], [124.79, 124.97, " green"], [124.97, 125.33, " river."], [125.75, 125.93, " The"], [125.93, 126.15, " river"], [126.15, 126.43, " winds"], [126.43, 126.71, " through"], [126.71, 127.17, " canyons"], [127.17, 127.45, " far"], [127.45, 127.97, " below."]]}, {"start": 128.43, "end": 136.33, "text": "Verdict an honest frame. A spectacular daytime eruption. But this volcano has a second face.", "words": [[128.43, 128.87, " Verdict"], [128.87, 129.13, " an"], [129.13, 129.43, " honest"], [129.43, 129.81, " frame."], [132.03, 132.27, " A"], [132.27, 132.85, " spectacular"], [132.85, 133.31, " daytime"], [133.31, 133.79, " eruption."], [134.31, 134.45, " But"], [134.45, 134.69, " this"], [134.69, 135.13, " volcano"], [135.13, 135.55, " has"], [135.55, 135.75, " a"], [135.75, 135.91, " second"], [135.91, 136.33, " face."]]}, {"start": 138.94, "end": 143.86, "text": "Fuego in Guatemala is almost constantly active. A small explosion from the crater", "words": [[138.94, 139.1, " Fuego"], [139.1, 139.34, " in"], [139.34, 139.76, " Guatemala"], [139.76, 140.26, " is"], [140.26, 140.66, " almost"], [140.66, 141.18, " constantly"], [141.18, 141.7, " active."], [142.12, 142.4, " A"], [142.4, 142.62, " small"], [142.62, 143.2, " explosion"], [143.2, 143.42, " from"], [143.42, 143.64, " the"], [143.64, 143.86, " crater"]]}, {"start": 143.86, "end": 150.0, "text": "every 15 to 20 minutes. At night the crater glows red. This is November 2017.", "words": [[143.86, 144.48, " every"], [144.48, 144.96, " 15"], [144.96, 145.12, " to"], [145.12, 145.38, " 20"], [145.38, 145.78, " minutes."], [146.12, 146.4, " At"], [146.4, 146.58, " night"], [146.58, 146.78, " the"], [146.78, 147.02, " crater"], [147.02, 147.42, " glows"], [147.42, 147.74, " red."], [148.14, 148.42, " This"], [148.42, 148.72, " is"], [148.72, 149.1, " November"], [149.1, 150.0, " 2017."]]}, {"start": 150.0, "end": 158.18, "text": "Larger eruptions. Over 80 since 1999. One of them, the 31st of January 2018. A day later", "words": [[150.0, 150.94, " Larger"], [150.94, 151.66, " eruptions."], [151.92, 152.18, " Over"], [152.18, 152.46, " 80"], [152.46, 152.76, " since"], [152.76, 153.56, " 1999."], [154.18, 154.36, " One"], [154.36, 154.52, " of"], [154.52, 154.76, " them,"], [155.04, 155.14, " the"], [155.14, 155.78, " 31st"], [155.78, 155.9, " of"], [155.9, 156.36, " January"], [156.36, 157.16, " 2018."], [157.66, 157.76, " A"], [157.76, 157.92, " day"], [157.92, 158.18, " later"]]}, {"start": 158.18, "end": 162.88, "text": "the Landsat 8 satellite photographed the ash plume. Verdict the frame chooses.", "words": [[158.18, 158.36, " the"], [158.36, 158.78, " Landsat"], [158.78, 159.0, " 8"], [159.0, 159.52, " satellite"], [159.52, 160.2, " photographed"], [160.2, 160.5, " the"], [160.5, 160.74, " ash"], [160.74, 161.22, " plume."], [161.68, 161.94, " Verdict"], [161.94, 162.14, " the"], [162.14, 162.36, " frame"], [162.36, 162.88, " chooses."]]}, {"start": 164.8, "end": 170.92, "text": "A viewpoint and one canyon slope. Is this the whole Copper Canyon? No, it is one piece of it.", "words": [[164.8, 164.94, " A"], [164.94, 165.34, " viewpoint"], [165.34, 165.66, " and"], [165.66, 165.88, " one"], [165.88, 166.24, " canyon"], [166.24, 166.6, " slope."], [167.08, 167.24, " Is"], [167.24, 167.44, " this"], [167.44, 167.64, " the"], [167.64, 167.82, " whole"], [167.82, 168.2, " Copper"], [168.2, 168.58, " Canyon?"], [169.12, 169.48, " No,"], [169.54, 169.66, " it"], [169.66, 169.9, " is"], [169.9, 170.1, " one"], [170.1, 170.34, " piece"], [170.34, 170.5, " of"], [170.5, 170.92, " it."]]}, {"start": 172.84, "end": 177.04, "text": "Copper Canyon is not one canyon. It is a system of six canyons.", "words": [[172.84, 173.16, " Copper"], [173.16, 173.58, " Canyon"], [173.58, 173.92, " is"], [173.92, 174.14, " not"], [174.14, 174.38, " one"], [174.38, 174.76, " canyon."], [175.2, 175.34, " It"], [175.34, 175.58, " is"], [175.58, 175.66, " a"], [175.66, 175.96, " system"], [175.96, 176.2, " of"], [176.2, 176.48, " six"], [176.48, 177.04, " canyons."]]}, {"start": 177.04, "end": 183.6, "text": "Six rivers cut them. Together 65,000 square kilometers. That is in the Sierra Madre", "words": [[177.04, 177.74, " Six"], [177.74, 178.12, " rivers"], [178.12, 178.36, " cut"], [178.36, 178.9, " them."], [179.1, 179.5, " Together"], [179.5, 180.08, " 65"], [180.08, 180.72, ",000"], [180.72, 181.06, " square"], [181.06, 181.64, " kilometers."], [182.12, 182.34, " That"], [182.34, 182.56, " is"], [182.56, 182.7, " in"], [182.7, 182.86, " the"], [182.86, 183.14, " Sierra"], [183.14, 183.6, " Madre"]]}, {"start": 183.6, "end": 187.32, "text": "Occidental. From above it looks like a maze of ridges and gorges.", "words": [[183.6, 184.24, " Occidental."], [184.72, 184.92, " From"], [184.92, 185.2, " above"], [185.2, 185.3, " it"], [185.3, 185.5, " looks"], [185.5, 185.78, " like"], [185.78, 185.9, " a"], [185.9, 186.12, " maze"], [186.12, 186.32, " of"], [186.32, 186.66, " ridges"], [186.66, 186.9, " and"], [186.9, 187.32, " gorges."]]}, {"start": 187.78, "end": 191.9, "text": "It stretches all the way to the horizon. Verdict reality is bigger.", "words": [[187.78, 188.06, " It"], [188.06, 188.34, " stretches"], [188.34, 188.74, " all"], [188.74, 188.88, " the"], [188.88, 189.02, " way"], [189.02, 189.16, " to"], [189.16, 189.32, " the"], [189.32, 189.8, " horizon."], [190.36, 190.8, " Verdict"], [190.8, 191.26, " reality"], [191.26, 191.54, " is"], [191.54, 191.9, " bigger."]]}, {"start": 193.58, "end": 197.38, "text": "From a drone, a tidy grid of streets. A city drawn with a ruler.", "words": [[193.58, 193.74, " From"], [193.74, 193.94, " a"], [193.94, 194.18, " drone,"], [194.5, 194.64, " a"], [194.64, 194.82, " tidy"], [194.82, 195.04, " grid"], [195.04, 195.28, " of"], [195.28, 195.56, " streets."], [196.02, 196.24, " A"], [196.24, 196.46, " city"], [196.46, 196.76, " drawn"], [196.76, 196.96, " with"], [196.96, 197.14, " a"], [197.14, 197.38, " ruler."]]}, {"start": 197.88, "end": 202.92, "text": "But what does it look like from the ground? This is Black Rock City.", "words": [[197.88, 198.06, " But"], [198.06, 198.24, " what"], [198.24, 198.36, " does"], [198.36, 198.5, " it"], [198.5, 198.64, " look"], [198.64, 198.84, " like"], [198.84, 199.0, " from"], [199.0, 199.2, " the"], [199.2, 199.48, " ground?"], [201.6, 201.82, " This"], [201.82, 202.06, " is"], [202.06, 202.34, " Black"], [202.34, 202.6, " Rock"], [202.6, 202.92, " City."]]}, {"start": 204.18, "end": 211.54, "text": "2019. 78,850 participants. Nine days up to Labor Day. In the Black Rock Desert in Nevada.", "words": [[204.18, 204.74, " 2019."], [204.74, 205.3, " 78"], [205.3, 206.6, ",850"], [206.6, 207.36, " participants."], [207.72, 208.02, " Nine"], [208.02, 208.4, " days"], [208.4, 208.7, " up"], [208.7, 208.88, " to"], [208.88, 209.12, " Labor"], [209.12, 209.48, " Day."], [209.9, 209.98, " In"], [209.98, 210.2, " the"], [210.2, 210.44, " Black"], [210.44, 210.64, " Rock"], [210.64, 211.02, " Desert"], [211.02, 211.22, " in"], [211.22, 211.54, " Nevada."]]}, {"start": 212.16, "end": 217.62, "text": "Now come down to the ground. Dust hangs in the air. The city is seen from a bicycle saddle.", "words": [[212.16, 212.32, " Now"], [212.32, 212.56, " come"], [212.56, 212.78, " down"], [212.78, 212.92, " to"], [212.92, 213.1, " the"], [213.1, 213.48, " ground."], [213.92, 214.18, " Dust"], [214.18, 214.44, " hangs"], [214.44, 214.64, " in"], [214.64, 214.76, " the"], [214.76, 215.06, " air."], [215.52, 215.72, " The"], [215.72, 215.92, " city"], [215.92, 216.2, " is"], [216.2, 216.4, " seen"], [216.4, 216.64, " from"], [216.64, 216.8, " a"], [216.8, 217.18, " bicycle"], [217.18, 217.62, " saddle."]]}, {"start": 218.18, "end": 224.88, "text": "Verdict the frame chooses. Leaves then two volcanoes across the lake. Clouds sit over", "words": [[218.18, 218.56, " Verdict"], [218.56, 218.8, " the"], [218.8, 218.98, " frame"], [218.98, 219.54, " chooses."], [221.3, 221.74, " Leaves"], [221.74, 221.98, " then"], [221.98, 222.32, " two"], [222.32, 222.7, " volcanoes"], [222.7, 223.14, " across"], [223.14, 223.36, " the"], [223.36, 223.66, " lake."], [224.06, 224.58, " Clouds"], [224.58, 224.68, " sit"], [224.68, 224.88, " over"]]}, {"start": 224.88, "end": 232.2, "text": "the summit. Here the weather does half the work. Ometepe is one island made of two volcanoes.", "words": [[224.88, 225.1, " the"], [225.1, 225.36, " summit."], [225.94, 226.08, " Here"], [226.08, 226.26, " the"], [226.26, 226.48, " weather"], [226.48, 226.74, " does"], [226.74, 226.98, " half"], [226.98, 227.16, " the"], [227.16, 227.5, " work."], [229.56, 230.06, " Ometepe"], [230.06, 230.36, " is"], [230.36, 230.62, " one"], [230.62, 230.96, " island"], [230.96, 231.2, " made"], [231.2, 231.38, " of"], [231.38, 231.6, " two"], [231.6, 232.2, " volcanoes."]]}, {"start": 232.2, "end": 238.3, "text": "Concepcion and Maderas are joined by a low isthmus. The island is 31 kilometers long", "words": [[232.2, 233.32, " Concepcion"], [233.32, 233.44, " and"], [233.44, 233.96, " Maderas"], [233.96, 234.38, " are"], [234.38, 234.66, " joined"], [234.66, 234.86, " by"], [234.86, 235.04, " a"], [235.04, 235.2, " low"], [235.2, 235.94, " isthmus."], [236.12, 236.26, " The"], [236.26, 236.6, " island"], [236.6, 236.96, " is"], [236.96, 237.36, " 31"], [237.36, 237.88, " kilometers"], [237.88, 238.3, " long"]]}, {"start": 238.3, "end": 243.58, "text": "and 5 to 10 kilometers wide. Concepcion is active with a textbook cone.", "words": [[238.3, 238.9, " and"], [238.9, 239.16, " 5"], [239.16, 239.32, " to"], [239.32, 239.64, " 10"], [239.64, 240.1, " kilometers"], [240.1, 240.58, " wide."], [241.1, 241.64, " Concepcion"], [241.64, 241.88, " is"], [241.88, 242.36, " active"], [242.36, 242.64, " with"], [242.64, 242.86, " a"], [242.86, 243.18, " textbook"], [243.18, 243.58, " cone."]]}, {"start": 244.02, "end": 248.36, "text": "Its base is 16 kilometers across. The slopes are covered in dense green.", "words": [[244.02, 244.24, " Its"], [244.24, 244.5, " base"], [244.5, 244.7, " is"], [244.7, 245.16, " 16"], [245.16, 245.64, " kilometers"], [245.64, 246.1, " across."], [246.54, 246.8, " The"], [246.8, 246.96, " slopes"], [246.96, 247.22, " are"], [247.22, 247.46, " covered"], [247.46, 247.74, " in"], [247.74, 247.96, " dense"], [247.96, 248.36, " green."]]}, {"start": 248.88, "end": 252.94, "text": "Higher up, the ridge vanishes into cloud. Verdict an honest frame.", "words": [[248.88, 249.12, " Higher"], [249.12, 249.42, " up,"], [249.54, 249.68, " the"], [249.68, 249.84, " ridge"], [249.84, 250.3, " vanishes"], [250.3, 250.6, " into"], [250.6, 251.02, " cloud."], [251.54, 252.02, " Verdict"], [252.02, 252.22, " an"], [252.22, 252.54, " honest"], [252.54, 252.94, " frame."]]}, {"start": 255.18, "end": 260.14, "text": "A branch in the foreground, haze behind it. No person in sight, so again no scale.", "words": [[255.18, 255.44, " A"], [255.44, 255.62, " branch"], [255.62, 255.78, " in"], [255.78, 255.92, " the"], [255.92, 256.38, " foreground,"], [256.72, 256.98, " haze"], [256.98, 257.3, " behind"], [257.3, 257.66, " it."], [257.92, 258.16, " No"], [258.16, 258.48, " person"], [258.48, 258.72, " in"], [258.72, 258.96, " sight,"], [259.16, 259.34, " so"], [259.34, 259.56, " again"], [259.56, 259.82, " no"], [259.82, 260.14, " scale."]]}, {"start": 262.45, "end": 270.47, "text": "The Grand Canyon is 277 miles long. That is 446 kilometers. Up to 18 miles wide.", "words": [[262.45, 262.75, " The"], [262.75, 263.11, " Grand"], [263.11, 263.63, " Canyon"], [263.63, 264.09, " is"], [264.09, 265.23, " 277"], [265.23, 265.57, " miles"], [265.57, 265.95, " long."], [266.43, 266.43, " That"], [266.43, 266.75, " is"], [266.75, 267.81, " 446"], [267.81, 268.49, " kilometers."], [268.99, 269.15, " Up"], [269.15, 269.31, " to"], [269.31, 269.67, " 18"], [269.67, 270.03, " miles"], [270.03, 270.47, " wide."]]}, {"start": 270.89, "end": 276.41, "text": "And over a mile deep. Now the Bright Angel Trail. The path is only a thin line of switchbacks", "words": [[270.89, 271.11, " And"], [271.11, 271.35, " over"], [271.35, 271.49, " a"], [271.49, 271.69, " mile"], [271.69, 272.05, " deep."], [272.53, 272.71, " Now"], [272.71, 272.91, " the"], [272.91, 273.11, " Bright"], [273.11, 273.39, " Angel"], [273.39, 273.79, " Trail."], [274.29, 274.41, " The"], [274.41, 274.69, " path"], [274.69, 274.93, " is"], [274.93, 275.19, " only"], [275.19, 275.43, " a"], [275.43, 275.59, " thin"], [275.59, 275.83, " line"], [275.83, 276.03, " of"], [276.03, 276.41, " switchbacks"]]}, {"start": 276.41, "end": 281.57, "text": "on the wall. At sunset a single hiker shows the scale. The rock temples below catch the", "words": [[276.41, 276.57, " on"], [276.57, 276.75, " the"], [276.75, 276.93, " wall."], [277.41, 277.61, " At"], [277.61, 277.97, " sunset"], [277.97, 278.13, " a"], [278.13, 278.43, " single"], [278.43, 278.79, " hiker"], [278.79, 279.09, " shows"], [279.09, 279.35, " the"], [279.35, 279.61, " scale."], [280.09, 280.23, " The"], [280.23, 280.45, " rock"], [280.45, 280.77, " temples"], [280.77, 281.13, " below"], [281.13, 281.35, " catch"], [281.35, 281.57, " the"]]}, {"start": 281.57, "end": 288.43, "text": "last light. Verdict reality is bigger. Let's count. Three times the frame chose.", "words": [[281.57, 281.83, " last"], [281.83, 282.19, " light."], [282.69, 283.13, " Verdict"], [283.13, 283.59, " reality"], [283.59, 283.89, " is"], [283.89, 284.19, " bigger."], [285.75, 286.13, " Let's"], [286.13, 286.47, " count."], [287.09, 287.35, " Three"], [287.35, 287.61, " times"], [287.61, 287.85, " the"], [287.85, 288.03, " frame"], [288.03, 288.43, " chose."]]}, {"start": 288.43, "end": 292.45, "text": "Three times reality was bigger. Twice the frame was honest.", "words": [[288.43, 289.13, " Three"], [289.13, 289.51, " times"], [289.51, 289.99, " reality"], [289.99, 290.23, " was"], [290.23, 290.71, " bigger."], [291.13, 291.35, " Twice"], [291.35, 291.63, " the"], [291.63, 291.73, " frame"], [291.73, 292.01, " was"], [292.01, 292.45, " honest."]]}, {"start": 292.99, "end": 295.31, "text": "Vlogs do not lie. Vlogs frame.", "words": [[292.99, 293.41, " Vlogs"], [293.41, 293.53, " do"], [293.53, 293.73, " not"], [293.73, 294.07, " lie."], [294.65, 295.07, " Vlogs"], [295.07, 295.31, " frame."]]}, {"start": 296.01, "end": 300.19, "text": "Which play surprised you most? Tell me in the comments which one to check next.", "words": [[296.01, 296.21, " Which"], [296.21, 296.41, " play"], [296.41, 296.83, " surprised"], [296.83, 297.03, " you"], [297.03, 297.41, " 